==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Pachirisu|49}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Attack the Wound''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Morpeko|78}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

